+# wrapText notes
+
+## Plan
+1. Add `wrapText(text, width)` to `src/cli/wrap.ts`.
+   - Split on whitespace; greedily fill lines up to `width`.
+   - Words no longer than `width` are never split; they move to the next line.
+   - Words longer than `width` are hard-split into `width`-sized chunks.
+   - Empty/whitespace-only text returns `[]`; width must be a positive integer (RangeError otherwise).
+2. Add `test/cli/wrap.test.ts` (node:test).
+3. Run `npm run fast`, then commit.
